# Files that may name the assistant tool as a documented dependency, and why.
# Format: path-glob | reason
# Only the exact dependency name is allowed in these files; credit lines and trailers never are.
README.md | Install instructions name the plugin host this repository is a plugin for.
.claude-plugin/*.json | The plugin manifests describe which assistants the skills run in.
tools/install-codex.py | The docstring says which assistant needs no install script.
